GLiNER2.5 Decide Android host sample

Model: fastino/GLiNER2.5-Decide, revision 7ee5da4c2415e32259bcdc0b1a7367c32ce8d6f6,
licensed under Apache License 2.0 (model card base_model: fastino/gliner2-large-v1).
Its encoder is DeBERTa-v3-large (microsoft/deberta-v3-large), licensed under the MIT License.

The input builder and the classification decoder are Kotlin ports of the gliner2 2.0.0
classification path from Fastino AI's GLiNER2 project, licensed under Apache License 2.0:
processor.py schema and input formatting, processing/word_splitter.py and the
inference/runtime.py classification post-processing. Changes include Kotlin float32
arithmetic, the float16 embedding-table upcast, fixed graph windows, and rejection of
inputs that gliner2 would decode under another task's settings.

The tokenizer follows the published DeBERTa-v3 tokenizer JSON contract of Hugging Face
tokenizers and transformers (Apache License 2.0).

The debug gate asset app/src/debug/assets/gate_fixtures.json contains the README examples
of fastino/GLiNER2.5-Decide and rows of the public dev split of fastino/fast-decisions
(revision 1a33070cabf94ce2e29105482dd2ef6c157ad7f2), both licensed under Apache License 2.0.

Gradle wrapper files retain their upstream Apache License 2.0 headers.
Retained model/runtime/encoder licenses are under licenses/.
